node unfold commander
  The rock unfolds. Halcyon plates slide apart, and a Ward-Engine rises out of the hill to face you.
  -> lock

node lock knight
  It shrugged off a sword. Check what it's weak to before we waste another swing.
  -> bolt

node bolt redmage
